# basePath DesignCh6
// Depletion 2

::Intro
@trigger    OnDesignSetupComplete
$set temp:hintGiven = 0
    {@PAL} Gates work on N-type too. With a LO signal, they flip N-type to P-Type.

::TwoInputs
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "success"
{@PAL} There are two Inputs now! Flip them both to run all four tests.

::Hints
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$if temp:hintGiven == 0
    {@PAL}  Hint: Check the Verification Table. When B is LO, block signals from reaching the output.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 1
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 1
    {@PAL}  Hint: A reaches the output, and B controls the gate.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 2
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 2
    {@PAL}  Hint: Use Vias to connect semiconductor back to the inputs and outputs on the metal layer.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 0
$endif